:: c3 [c3 crystal-cavern-entrance map]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Take in the view->c3: the view]]</li>
      <li>[[Rummage around in the long grass->c3: long grass]]</li>
      <li>[[Talk to the scientist.->c3: scientist]]</li>
      <li>[[Enter the cave->c2]]</li>
      <li>[[Climb back down.->c4]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'c3'>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'c3'>>
</div>

:: c3: the view [c3 crystal-cavern-entrance description]
<p>You look out over the cliff and take in the beauty.</p>
<p>You can see Littlemoose from here, a ways to the south. Some of it's tall buildings stick out among the dense forest.</p>
<p>To the West, you can see Blue Urf. You notice that the lights that usually dot the city don't seem to be working.</p>
<p>Further in that direction, the peaks of Raven Wing mountain are barely visible.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>